cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SciView to communicate your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SciView: scientific explainer videos from a visual editor or Python"
abstract: >-
  SciView is an open-source tool for making scientific explainer videos. Films are built from objects
  such as particle beams, samples, detectors, charts, equations and captions, timed and keyframed in a
  browser-based editor or from Python, and rendered to video with a pure NumPy/OpenCV/Pillow renderer.
type: software
